1
00:00:00,388 --> 00:00:02,688
(Howard:)- All right.
- Wolowitz went to MIT.

2
00:00:02,857 --> 00:00:04,617
(Sheldon:)What's your educational background?

3
00:00:04,793 --> 00:00:07,523
- I went to art school.
- Equally ridiculous. Let's go.

4
00:00:29,784 --> 00:00:33,724
(Sheldon:)This insistence on hand-holding
is preposterous.

5
00:00:34,289 --> 00:00:37,659
- Well, I like it.
- Yeah, of course you do, you're a girl.

6
00:00:37,826 --> 00:00:40,586
(Sheldon:)You like all kinds
of hippie-dippy things.

7
00:00:41,196 --> 00:00:42,996
(Amy:)Just watch the movie.

8
00:00:45,500 --> 00:00:47,260
(Sheldon:)It's not fair.

9
00:00:47,435 --> 00:00:50,095
(Sheldon:)Penny isn't making Leonard
hold hands.

10
00:00:51,639 --> 00:00:53,269
(Amy:)There might be a reason for that.

11
00:00:53,942 --> 00:00:55,812
(Sheldon:)Sweaty...

12
00:00:56,277 --> 00:00:58,147
(Sheldon:)...unhygienic...

13
00:00:58,313 --> 00:01:02,023
...Iooks dumb, take your pick.

